'''''You Already Know Me''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[The Dawn After the Dark (Companion Mission Chapter)|The Dawn After the Dark]].

==Steps==
# Ask Himeko about the rumors in the space station
# Head to the space station and find the whereabouts of Gossipmonger
# Ask for the whereabouts of the Gossipmonger from other researchers
# Speak with the Security Department member and enter the locked area

