::{{Диалог|Выход}} I don't have any other questions.
;(Otherwise)
::'''Welt:''' You should record anything interesting you come across during your adventures. In the end, they might just become important points of conversation.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Show Kafka's message.
::'''Welt:''' ...Kafka and Blade are still on the Xianzhou? The general nearly released them outright, but that was then. If memory serves, the Xianzhou only revoked Kafka's arrest warrant. Blade is still a wanted criminal...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do you think I should do?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What do you think her motive is?
::'''Welt:''' To be honest, I can never figure out what those Stellaron Hunters are up to, especially that Kafka...
::'''Welt:''' ...but my intuition tells me she won't do anything to harm you. If she's really in trouble, it'd be best to go see her.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Report the findings of your investigation into the unknown signal...
::{{Black Screen|You explain the results of the investigation to Welt and Himeko...}}
::'''Himeko:''' Heh... Interesting. What a surprising turn of events.
::'''Himeko:''' I knew the IPC had been on this planet before the Eternal Freeze, but as far as I was aware, it had pulled everyone out before the Antimatter Legion officially landed on Jarilo-VI.
::'''Himeko:''' I didn't think they would actually send someone to keep an eye on a planet engulfed in the Eternal Freeze... That however does sounds like their way of doing things.
::'''Welt:''' Since it's just an ad message, it shouldn't pose a threat to Jarilo-VI. Thanks to your findings, we can all rest easy after all.
::'''Welt:''' As promised, Himeko and I have prepared a reward for you.
::'''Himeko:''' ...Huh? Whose phone is ringing?
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.PlayMessage",
	"MessageSectionID": 1112700
}</pre>
::'''Welt:''' History after the Eternal Freeze... Our data bank doesn't seem to have any relevant documents on this topic.
::'''Himeko:''' Looks like the go-getter on our crew, (Trailblazer), has another new mission. Good luck!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How can I learn about that history?
:::'''Himeko:''' Hehe. That's where our Trailblaze comes in.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I really don't want to go...
:::'''Himeko:''' Hehe. I knew you would say that.
:::'''Welt:''' The way I see it, this is a good opportunity to enrich the Express' data bank... I assume you don't yet know everything about this planet, and you might as well take this chance to learn a bit about its history. What say you, (Trailblazer)?
:::'''Himeko:''' Welt is right. As for where you should go to learn about this history...
::'''Himeko:''' If my memory still serves me well... You've connected with a young Supreme Guardian during this journey. Isn't that right?
::'''Himeko:''' She is likely the person closest to the true history of the planet. Go and ask her. You might learn something.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll be on my way then.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How about giving me my rewards first?
:::'''Himeko:''' Hehe. Not so quick, (Trailblazer). This investigation is now being extended, so it's not quite the time to dole out rewards just yet.
:::'''Welt:''' ...Don't take advantage of (Trailblazer). But Himeko does have a point. We will give you your reward after this matter has been completely resolved.
::'''Himeko:''' Have a safe trip, (Trailblazer). I hope your journey will prove fruitful.
::{{Black Screen|You explain the results of the investigation to Welt and Himeko...}}
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Report your findings of the history before the Eternal Freeze.
::{{Black Screen|You explain what you learned about the history prior to the Eternal Freeze to Welt and Himeko...}}
::'''Himeko:''' Hmmm... So that was how Belobog was established. Didn't know that they had a calendar system like this...
::'''Welt:''' Good work, (Trailblazer). And with that, we can finally have records on the time before and after the Eternal Freeze in our data bank.
::'''Himeko:''' You never let us down, (Trailblazer). I suppose if we ever have a problem, we can just leave it in your capable hands. Now then, we can finally give that reward to...
::'''Himeko & Welt:''' ...
::'''Welt:''' ...(Trailblazer). I think your phone is ringing again. Don't you want to check it?
:<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.PlayMessage",
	"MessageSectionID": 1113000
}</pre>
::'''Himeko:''' ...You're truly the very definition of indomitable. This investigation must've been quite the chore for you, (Trailblazer).
::'''Welt:''' Keep up the good work. Come, this is the reward that Himeko and I have prepared for you.
::'''Himeko:''' I hope... these can make up for any mental damage you've endured during this investigation.
::{{Black Screen|You explain the results of the investigation to Welt and Himeko...}}
