===Head to the space station and find the whereabouts of Gossipmonger{{subst:void|<!--200020102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Master Control Zone|update|Himeko recommends you to find the person making the rumor. With her help, you learn that a researcher nicknamed "Gossipmonger" may know the true identity of the one who created the rumor.<br />You decide to look for Gossipmonger at the place she frequents.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)
