===Ask for the whereabouts of the Gossipmonger from other researchers{{subst:void|<!--200020103-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Master Control Zone|update|You waited for the Gossipmonger at her usual spot for what seemed like a long time when you realized from the researchers around that the gossip has already spread.<br />You couldn't wait for the Gossipmonger to show up, although you did manage to get her whereabouts from other researchers.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:<!--1-second delay-->
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (The rumors are already circulating. Let's gather some intel first.)
;(Unused &mdash; Mission_200020103_Prop_39_300005_BtnClick)
:'''Surprised Researcher:''' Why are you still here? Didn't your department call you to prepare for the emergency operation?
::'''Researcher at a Loss:''' Uh... no? I just sneaked out for a little while. What are the odds...
::'''Surprised Researcher:''' I got a group message two minutes ago saying that {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|something's happened in the Special Purpose Lab &mdash; somebody's trapped}}. The Security Department's blocked off the area around the entrance.
::'''Researcher at a Loss:''' The Special Purpose Lab? Then wouldn't {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Pamela &mdash; I mean, Gossipmonger be...}}
::'''Surprised Researcher:''' Most likely. No wonder she's not here right now...

;(Unused &mdash; Mission_200020103_Prop_39_300003_BtnClick)
:'''Off Work Researcher:''' Have you heard anything from Gossipmonger? Is the lead researcher really that corrupt? Who exactly is this whistleblower?
::'''Curious Researcher:''' Hey, aren't you off work today?
::'''Off Work Researcher:''' I couldn't not come in after checking my phone! Days off aren't as juicy as gossip.
::'''Curious Researcher:''' Well, too bad, I haven't seen Gossipmonger this morning. You should rest up and wait for more news.
::'''Off Work Researcher:''' *sigh* You're right...

;(Unused &mdash; Mission_200020103_Prop_39_300004_BtnClick)
:'''Researcher Talking to Herself:''' Gossipmonger only concerns herself with gossip, not the secrets within.
::'''Researcher Talking to Herself:''' There aren't many members in the Heritor group, but news is still traveling so fast. This must be the work of something bigger...
::'''Researcher Talking to Herself:''' ...Hmm... Given the number of people in the group and its content... could this all stem from a few alt accounts? But why kick up a storm like this...
{{Dialogue End}}

===Speak with the Security Department member and enter the locked area{{subst:void|<!--200020104-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Master Control Zone|update|You make your way toward the Special Purpose Lab, but the Security Department has already locked down the entire area. You decide to ask Security Department members about the area in which the Gossipmonger is trapped.<br />Despite their repeated attempts to discourage you, you insist on entering the blocked area to rescue the Gossipmonger, Pamela.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Security Department Member)
:'''Security Department Member:''' The walkways around the Special Purpose Lab have been temporarily closed off. Please keep your distance.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can you let me through just this once?
::'''Security Department Member:''' I'm afraid this is a live situation. It's too dangerous.
::'''Security Department Member:''' Wait... Brother Arlan told me about you. If you insist on going... then I wish you the best of luck. Be safe.
